body: |-
  RESTART HERE. Branch: conductor-revival-phase0 (commits through 21c4041c / history h0470). Not merged; Matt publishes/merges himself.

  WHAT'S BUILT (this session, all Swift-owned): ATRIUM keystone (claude -p stream-json conversation in custom UI) → full composer (NSTextView clipboard+multiline, file-drop chips, voice keyword loop "respond"/"send it" + Settings keyword config) → Stop (control_request interrupt) → background-bash shell inspect/kill (TaskStop) → login-shell PATH fix → inspectable per-session transcripts (~/.paradigm/conductor/atrium/*.jsonl) → THE CHORUS (sub-agent display, deterministic via tool_use_id + task_type) → THE BRIDGE (full-screen fleet cockpit: FleetStore owns N sessions; spine|ATRIUM|CHORUS; derived status + temperature law + page-back; spawn/switch/close; ConductorCockpitWindow; AtriumSpikeWindow retired). Launch: open packages/conductor/build/Conductor.app, ⌘⇧A.

  ON RESTART: (1) read this + the build plan [[L-2026-06-15-ascend-215150-001]] + the prior session checkpoint [[L-2026-06-16-ascend-091000-001]] (has the VERIFIED claude -p protocol facts: control_request interrupt, TaskStop, task_type local_agent/local_bash, tool_use_id correlation, the macOS LSUIElement/TCC/PATH gotchas) + arc memory project_conductor_symphony_aaloud_arc. (2) Matt is TESTING THE BRIDGE — expect reactions/changes. (3) Then Matt has ANOTHER MAJOR FEATURE re: this new view/interaction — let him describe it. 

  DISCIPLINE: Swift ecosystem agent owns ALL Conductor Swift implementation (protocol-enforced this session). Debug runtime via the ~/.paradigm/conductor/atrium transcripts (READ them, don't screenshot-guess). Run the BUNDLED .app (not the bare binary) for mic/TCC + true behavior. NO Markdown blockquotes in output (global rule).

  OPEN v2 ITEMS: full nested sub-agent transcript drill-in (needs parent_tool_use_id on inner tool calls); needs-human (amber) as a first-class stream signal (currently heuristic; noteNeedsHuman() hook reserved); UserNotifications/voice page-back; git branch in session row; voice "no words typed" live-verify; per-session composer-draft persistence; session persistence across app restart (claude --resume); interrupt-mid-Bash-tool live-confirm. Pre-existing pending: merge conductor-revival-phase0.
